  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Uh-Oh! Bonesy needs your help to put him together!


    Notice how the
    ghostly skeleton to the left has certain parts glowing in purple.


    In the
    pit to the right, find the bone that corresponds to the glowing piece.


    Then,
    grab it and put it in the same spot where the glowing piece is. It should snap
    in place and lock itself.


    Repeat this process until you finish building
    all of Bonesy!'
